# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vardholm / MysteriousIsland — Unity 6 (6000.6.0f1) ignore rules.
#
# Rule of thumb: if the Unity Editor can regenerate it from Assets/ +
# ProjectSettings/ + Packages/, it does not belong in git. Everything else does.
# In particular Assets/**/*.meta IS tracked — a missing .meta re-randomises a
# GUID and silently detaches every reference to that asset.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Unity generated folders (regenerated on import) -----------------------
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/

# The same folders when the project is nested one level down (worktrees, CI checkouts).
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
**/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/

# Asset Store drops are re-downloadable and enormous.
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]sset[Ss]tore[Tt]ools*
/[Aa]ssets/[Pp]lugins/[Ee]ditor/JetBrains*

# --- IDE project files (regenerated by com.unity.ide.*) --------------------
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.userprefs
*.booproj
*.pidb
*.suo
*.svd
*.unityproj
*.tmp
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.consulo/

# --- Build outputs ---------------------------------------------------------
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.app
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt
ExportedObj/

# Gradle / Xcode staging produced by a mobile build.
/[Ss]taging[Aa]rea/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

# --- Burst / IL2CPP intermediates ------------------------------------------
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# --- OS noise --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local-only developer state --------------------------------------------
# Save files written by a local Play session land in persistentDataPath, not
# here, but a developer who points SaveFileStore at the repo for debugging
# should not be able to commit a save by accident.
*.vardsave
*.vardsave.bak
__pycache__/
